WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,950
Who said my husband came to see your brother today?

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,880
Then what are you doing?

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,880
Watch the excitement

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,080
I want to participate

5
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,310
My husband came to see me

6
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:13,500
Don't cry if you lose

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,100
This is what I should say to Mr. Lu.

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,380
Then I'll be waiting

9
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:22,170
you don't have to

10
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,870
I don't want to see you being bullied

11
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:26,900
Don't worry, you said it

12
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,900
I raised you

13
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:38,050
Go pick out the best ones for him?

14
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:50,100
His Royal Highness has arrived
